<body>
    <h1>BRD - Centralized Leave Management System (CLMS)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"42c3ee975af3"><strong>1.Document Overview &amp; Busi=
ness Purpose</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5c56a73b3d60">The purpose of this project is to centralize a=
nd automate the organization=E2=80=99s currently fragmented leave managemen=
t process. By replacing manual, email-based tracking with an automated syst=
em, the organization aims to reduce Leave Balance calculation errors, decre=
ase HR operational overhead, and provide real-time visibility into employee=
 attendance.</p>
<p local-id=3D"121be248857c"><strong>2.Business Objectives </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"7452db7abec6">=E2=80=A2 Standardization: Establish a unified=
, automated leave application and approval workflow across all organization=
al departments.</p>
<p local-id=3D"464f55e4d0fe">=E2=80=A2 Accuracy: Eliminate manual data entr=
y errors in employee leave balance calculations.</p>
<p local-id=3D"afbd6e46eb78">=E2=80=A2 Efficiency: Reduce manual administra=
tive workload on the HR team by at least 50%.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d304f5fb603e">=E2=80=A2 Transparency: Provide employees and =
managers real-time visibility into leave balances and request statuses.</p>
<ol start=3D"3" local-id=3D"1405d949296e">
<li local-id=3D"4e2b3c4a151a">
<p local-id=3D"e83ef9ba7308"><strong>Stakeholder Roles &amp; Responsibiliti=
es</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"ab2=
c625a-d2e4-42af-90ec-48d065579da0" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"15d87c932f8a">
<th data-local-id=3D"e828a1b7774b" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"83aff3d23647">Stakeholder Group</p>
</th>
<th data-local-id=3D"a8153b5057df" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"dacc2d73df29">Project Role</p>
</th>
<th data-local-id=3D"fc1d974d8130" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2e88dd03fde1">Core System Responsibilities</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"dff9485381b4">
<td data-local-id=3D"a935aa4fdbc4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9e9330b6582f">Employees</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ccc0a15c209e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5efda2d46278">End User</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"94eb48a4e77d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aabce77c8ba4">Submit leave requests; view real-time balances=
 and status.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4d0bd0d97b05">
<td data-local-id=3D"64078c0e210d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"06941bb53b31">Managers</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"868fc1b6ef7e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c7bea20ac6d5">Approver</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a627f07e552" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"01ff655855bd">Review, approve, or reject team leave requests=
.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3332d38e27e3">
<td data-local-id=3D"f32a0ff40285" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9a0fdca324c8">HR Department</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b5cc3ba597b6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4e40a9106073">System Administrator / Owner</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5a3990a3824c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b9f5794400a4">Maintain leave policies, adjust master records=
, and oversee compliance.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"178960e1f4fc">
<td data-local-id=3D"1a3b88fc0665" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bd2b1281311b">Executive Management</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c8b1238a82bb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"27adedc4c3fb">Project Sponsor</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"76c130b9ae14" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0e8979d5513e">Review high-level usage reports and strategic =
attendance metrics.</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"775c67e29a26"><strong>4.Current State &amp; Problem Statemen=
t </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"d23b67167c7d">Currently, leave records are maintained manual=
ly across disparate emails and spreadsheets. This operational setup introdu=
ces several key issues:</p>
<p local-id=3D"8324b80b0951">=E2=80=A2 High Error Rate: Manual balance calc=
ulations lead to frequent discrepancies in employee leave balances.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7a238baa4384">=E2=80=A2 Administrative Overhead: HR spends e=
xcessive time manually verifying balances and updating records.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5ddc0cbebde8">=E2=80=A2 Lack of Visibility: Employees and ma=
nagers lack direct, real-time access to current attendance statuses and rem=
aining leave balances.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9a3d843b6e9e"><strong>5.Scope Definition</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"9a667ea24e0e">5.1 In-Scope</p>
<p local-id=3D"5e6c58013bfd">=E2=80=A2 Centralized leave application and mu=
lti-level approval workflows.</p>
<p local-id=3D"bf0a6021cff2">=E2=80=A2 Automated leave balance deduction an=
d real-time ledger updates.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5c9ffc0dbe32">=E2=80=A2 Automated email notifications for st=
atus updates and balance alerts.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d86f154c5662">=E2=80=A2 Role-based visibility dashboards for=
 Employees, Managers, and HR.</p>
<p local-id=3D"045a8acfd52a">5.2 Out-of-Scope</p>
<p local-id=3D"0115f6da288c">=E2=80=A2 Integration with Payroll processing =
systems (Phase 2 consideration).</p>
<p local-id=3D"ec29e83992a6">=E2=80=A2 Integration with physical biometric =
hardware/attendance terminals.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4cff66f592ae"><strong>6.Business Rules </strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"308a59013ed3">=E2=80=A2 BR-RULE-01 (Planned Leave Notice): P=
lanned leave requests must be submitted at least 7 calendar days prior to t=
he start date.</p>
<p local-id=3D"7ab06dbd7d74">=E2=80=A2 BR-RULE-02 (Emergency Exception): Un=
planned/Sick leave requests must be submitted within 24 hours of returning =
to work.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8ea3111902b6">=E2=80=A2 BR-RULE-03 (Approval Hierarchy): All=
 leave requests require direct Manager review prior to system finalization.=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"37cd5457682f">=E2=80=A2 BR-RULE-04 (Administrative Override)=
: Only authorized HR personnel possess administrative privileges to manuall=
y adjust accrued leave balances.</p>
<ol start=3D"7" local-id=3D"7bbc37fe1770">
<li local-id=3D"635b3b9fb167">
<p local-id=3D"2dba4a6c55a2"><strong>Functional Business Requirements</stro=
ng></p>
</li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"748" data-layout=3D"center" data-local-id=3D"e0f=
c3b2e-b888-4cd2-ab5a-ddd7a8060acd" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c00b6c09dc44">
<th data-local-id=3D"fc54605bf6e0" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"591e26bba9fa">ID</p>
</th>
<th data-local-id=3D"809d84746285" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"fe84fe53b559">Requirement Description</p>
</th>
<th data-local-id=3D"c1c5d4deb4b4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"2b7601a7ca9b">Priority</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e91aadae7b9f">
<td data-local-id=3D"8fc6ddaf7e49" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d752c28b637c">BR01</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"94926767b47c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e14568816d96">The system shall securely store employee profi=
les, work email addresses, and historical leave logs.</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"55630e60af8b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bdccc57b1885">High</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e1b317ee4ac3">
<td data-local-id=3D"028705674c64" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"48b72230352e">BR02</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3a82d6d4e7fe" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"027d6d9d57ad">The system shall provide a self-service portal=
 for employees to submit leave applications online.</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6f5729fac7e7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3ed9cc4f65d9">High</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1a0c0eed307a">
<td data-local-id=3D"5ba219ba214b" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a1e4199b1c2d">BR03</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9ae64b08f633" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4720b6723bcd">The system shall enforce Role-Based Access Con=
trol (RBAC), restricting master record editing privileges to HR administrat=
ors.</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"54e22a2889b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bbec17e81396">High</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb459ce4b50a">
<td data-local-id=3D"99306d91025a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3592d17120cc">BR04</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9e22d81be17f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ed92913d8a79">The system shall route leave requests to the e=
mployee=E2=80=99s assigned manager for approval or rejection.</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6cafe84b6914" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7785e662e021">High</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb074a73438d">
<td data-local-id=3D"d60487064f40" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"386b51ddc55a">BR05</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4ad3358832c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"23e41d66c3b0">The system shall automatically deduct approved=
 leave days from the employee's total leave balance upon approval.</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"015f4909d750" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a874f3f0a7e9">High</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6a21846252e5">
<td data-local-id=3D"70cae78b4b52" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c78a98fac177">BR06</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"d4c5e81a7fb0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4cd177d0e1ea">The system shall trigger automated email notif=
ications using official corporate email channels to update employees on req=
uest statuses and updated balances.</p>
</td>
<td data-local-id=3D"13010d2f7bc8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d61165f8afe8">Medium</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"024db9c0c07b"><strong>8.Assumptions &amp; Constraints</stron=
g></p>
<p local-id=3D"5732dcb7fd68">Assumptions</p>
<p local-id=3D"cd66c26b6caf">1. Comprehensive training will be provided to =
HR personnel and managers prior to system deployment.</p>
<p local-id=3D"0b5e17bcdfa9">2. Employees have access to company email addr=
esses and the internal network/portal.</p>
<p local-id=3D"aee5f74a65ef">Constraints</p>
<p local-id=3D"1f95b91950da">1. Timeline: The project must be deployed with=
in the agreed fixed timeline.</p>
<p local-id=3D"08c25bfbd56d">2. Budget: System design and implementation mu=
st strictly adhere to the allocated financial budget.</p>
<p local-id=3D"99355e50cc99"><strong>9.Success Criteria</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"5fd82c07ab09">=E2=80=A2 100% Centralization: All employee le=
ave records migrated to and managed within the new platform. =E2=80=A2 Zero=
 Discrepancies: Elimination of calculation errors in active employee leave =
balances.</p>
<p local-id=3D"15b51a99d40f">=E2=80=A2 Operational Efficiency: 50% reductio=
n in time spent by HR managing manual leave queries within 90 days of launc=
h.</p>
<ol start=3D"10" local-id=3D"790beb59c551">
<li local-id=3D"e6eda0258d86">
<p local-id=3D"7417823b4d6c"><strong>Document Approvals</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"32=
d0b2e1-bcfc-4de3-9990-0bf4429feb9c" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"734ecf1d1dac">
